{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/extras/67d37eb3573795175e62c36201e80ade.avif?t=1773027573\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/extras_big/67d37eb3573795175e62c36201e80ade.avif?t=1773027573 width=800 height=290 /></span><br>Having caused the Wizard a massive headache, you (and your ill-prepared companion) are temporarily banished from your home to play in the garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an enchanted piece of furniture, you can guide both friends and foes through the twists and turns of the mysterious garden - <strong>Ogora!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/extras/82fc018c3e4dd94760127a95c939161e.avif?t=1773027573\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/extras/2115e93f256e0b11ad7631da43a99d1b.poster.avif?t=1773027573\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/extras/2115e93f256e0b11ad7631da43a99d1b.webm?t=1773027573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/extras/2115e93f256e0b11ad7631da43a99d1b.mp4?t=1773027573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the magical garden of Ogora and test your mind (and your luck) against your enchanted friends - while the Wizard tries to get a moment of peace!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover secrets within the hedges of the garden (or make a path of your own!). But be careful, not everyone in the garden will aid you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/extras/87c9664d483c3ae674c541576638abe8.avif?t=1773027573\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/extras/9c74528650f0941e8e1070773548ccd2.poster.avif?t=1773027573\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/extras/9c74528650f0941e8e1070773548ccd2.webm?t=1773027573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/extras/9c74528650f0941e8e1070773548ccd2.mp4?t=1773027573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft new powers, ancient spells, or hoard your explosives for those pesky pillows and ornery ottomans that block your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with a massive number of unique cards, heavily guarded spells, and hidden trinkets \u2013 seriously, some of these are pretty secret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run will present new challenges, difficult choices, and a unique friend to help you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/extras/356e6a7c50bbb2a9cd231c9b02313392.avif?t=1773027573\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/extras/5ef69d55f47652fd9fbac9da5c66aa08.poster.avif?t=1773027573\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/extras/5ef69d55f47652fd9fbac9da5c66aa08.webm?t=1773027573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/extras/5ef69d55f47652fd9fbac9da5c66aa08.mp4?t=1773027573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your hero and choose a Partner to aid you in your journey. Each partner offers unique powers and abilities, so choose carefully!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whoever you don\u2019t choose is out to win, so make sure you\u2019re prepared!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own path as you journey through - Ogora!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3262090?t=1773027573","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773027573","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/a5905b4fa705cd282d0ef5c13331104348912020/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773027573","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/a5905b4fa705cd282d0ef5c13331104348912020/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773027573","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3265260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/extras/67d37eb3573795175e62c36201e80ade.avif?t=1773027573\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262090/extras_big/67d37eb3573795175e62c36201e80ade.avif?t=1773027573 width=800 height=290 /></span><br>Having 